    "summary": "Poll the PPC4000 with FC03 at 8N1 and the baud rate chosen on the control (4800-57600). Read operational state, modulation rate and the active error; write 1/0 with FC06 to 41002 to turn the burner on or off.",
    "minimum_registers": [
